    <irso:hasPlaybookDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The workflow automatically synchronizes URL blacklists across Palo Alto Firewall and Zscaler by adding or removing address objects from an address object group in your Palo Alto Firewall and blacklisting or unblacklisting URLs in Zscaler to keep them in sync bi-directionally on an hourly schedule.</irso:hasPlaybookDescription>
