    <irso:hasPlaybookDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Creates indicators for the host specified by the user, unblocks the host on the firewall, and also marks the indicator as Unblocked. The indicator is also linked to the record on which the playbook is triggered.</irso:hasPlaybookDescription>
