    <irso:hasPlaybookDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"> Setup Import the workflow from the Rapid7 Extension Library and proceed through the Workflow Control Panel in InsightConnect. Create or select Connections, specify the Parameters, and rename the Workflow as necessary. There are two Workflow Parameters you will need to configure in order to complete setup of your Workflow: * `Team Name`: Team name within Microsoft Teams that contains the channel you'd like to use for triggers &amp; responses* `Channel Name`: Channel name within Microsoft Teams you'd like to use for triggers &amp; responses </irso:hasPlaybookDescription>
