    <irso:hasPlaybookDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This workflow blocks or unblocks IPv4 and IPv6 addresses with Cisco ASA via Microsoft Teams command and reports information back to Microsoft Teams.</irso:hasPlaybookDescription>
