    <irso:hasPlaybookDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This playbook handles all the containment actions available with Cortex XSIAM, including:   * Isolate endpoint * Disable account * Quarantine file * Block indicators * Clear user session (currently, the playbook supports only Okta)  Note: The playbook inputs enable manipulating the execution flow read the input descriptions for details.</irso:hasPlaybookDescription>
