    <irso:hasPlaybookDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This workflow provides fast, convenient access to information about a given host from InsightVM by fetching asset details from InsightVM and posting them in a Microsoft Teams message. Host info includes hostname, IP address, MAC address, operating system, running services, last assessment date, and vulnerability stats. Lookup can be performed by either hostname or IP address.</irso:hasPlaybookDescription>
