    <irso:hasPlaybookID rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">p519</irso:hasPlaybookID>
    <irso:hasPlaybookName rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Enrich Indicators with OSINT from Microsoft Teams</irso:hasPlaybookName>
    <irso:hasPlaybookDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Threat Intelligence doesn’t have to come with a cost. This workflow uses open-source intelligence (OSINT) to perform domain lookups, header analysis, hash analysis, and more directly from Microsoft Teams. Just connect Microsoft Teams and activate this instant indicator enrichment workflow.</irso:hasPlaybookDescription>
