    <irso:hasPlaybookDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This playbook provides a framework for handling malware investigation through all essential steps. The playbook consists of 7 stages. Each stage contains the relevant playbook or tasks.  This playbook auto extracts indicators from incidents using indicator extraction rules of the malware incident type. To use Illusive integration in the `Forensics - Generic` playbook,  note that you will be able to set the forensic timeline by editing the `Forensics - Generic` playbook inputs.       </irso:hasPlaybookDescription>
