    <irso:hasPlaybookName rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Add Cisco Meraki L3 Firewall Rule to Networks from Slack</irso:hasPlaybookName>
    <irso:hasPlaybookDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This workflow adds the Cisco Meraki L3 firewall deny rule to all networks in the organization via Slack command and reports information back to Slack. This workflow updates the L3 firewall rules of each SSID on an MR network by adding a new rule with a deny traffic policy for each destination IP address provided in the command.</irso:hasPlaybookDescription>
