    <irso:hasPlaybookDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Disabling a compromised account can limit the scope of an attack and buy valuable time to investigate and contain the threat. This workflow disables or enables an Azure AD account with a simple Slack command.</irso:hasPlaybookDescription>
