    <irso:hasPlaybookName rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Check Host Block Status with Palo Alto Firewall from Slack</irso:hasPlaybookName>
    <irso:hasPlaybookDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This workflow accepts a Slack command containing an IP address or domain. This object will be checked against a pre-defined address group in a Palo Alto firewall to determine if the object is present or not. It is assumed that this address group will be used to store address objects for a block policy. A message with the results will be returned.</irso:hasPlaybookDescription>
