    <irso:hasPlaybookDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This workflow listens for InsightVM Webhook Events for newly discovered vulnerabilities, checks if a 2021 Exchange Server (CVE-2021-26412, CVE-2021-26854, CVE-2021-26855, CVE-2021-26857, CVE-2021-26858, CVE-2021-27065, or CVE-2021-27078) or derivative) vulnerability is present, and if found, posts a notification to a Slack channel.</irso:hasPlaybookDescription>
