    <irso:hasPlaybookName rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Lookup Host with InsightVM from Slack</irso:hasPlaybookName>
    <irso:hasPlaybookDescription rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This workflow provides fast, convenient access to information about a given host from InsightVM by fetching asset details from InsightVM and posting them in a Slack thread. Host info includes hostname, IP address, MAC address, operating system, running services, last assessment date, and vulnerability stats. Lookup can be performed by either hostname or IP address.</irso:hasPlaybookDescription>
